			Thankfully, there is currently no one here to see you in such an exposed state.
	<</if>><br>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<span style="color:Azure"><strong>-Actions-</strong></span><br>
<<if $Time.after(22) or $Time.before(6)>>
